### FitLog API Playground
### Works with VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
### Set @base and register once to get a token, then use it everywhere.

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

# ─── Auth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register a new account
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "athlete@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass1!",
  "name": "Demo Athlete"
}

###

### Login (copy access_token into @token above)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "athlete@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass1!"
}

###

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ─── Fitness Profile ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create a profile
POST {{base}}/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Muscle Build",
  "weight_kg": 80,
  "height_cm": 178,
  "age": 27,
  "gender": "male",
  "goal": "muscle"
}

###

### List profiles
GET {{base}}/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Daily protein target  (replace :id)
GET {{base}}/profile/:id/protein-target
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ─── Exercises ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create an exercise
POST {{base}}/exercises/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Barbell Squat",
  "category": "strength",
  "muscle_group": "legs",
  "description": "King of compound movements"
}

###

### List exercises
GET {{base}}/exercises/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ─── Workout Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Log a set  (replace exercise_id and profile_id)
POST {{base}}/logs/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exercise_id": "EXERCISE_UUID",
  "profile_id": "PROFILE_UUID",
  "log_date": "2026-01-20",
  "sets": 4,
  "reps": 6,
  "weight_kg": 120,
  "notes": "Felt strong today"
}

###

### List logs (filter by date range)
GET {{base}}/logs/?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ─── Nutrition ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Log macros manually
POST {{base}}/macros/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_date": "2026-01-20",
  "calories": 2800,
  "protein_g": 175,
  "carbs_g": 320,
  "fat_g": 75,
  "notes": "Chicken, rice, veggies"
}

###

### AI food analysis (Groq)
POST {{base}}/macros/analyze-food
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "200g grilled chicken breast with 150g brown rice and steamed broccoli"
}

# ─── AI Coach ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Chat with the AI coach
POST {{base}}/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profile_id": "PROFILE_UUID",
  "message": "I did squats and bench press today. What should I focus on tomorrow?"
}

# ─── Analytics ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Dashboard summary
GET {{base}}/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Weekly workout volume
GET {{base}}/analytics/workout-volume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Strength progression (1RM trend)
GET {{base}}/analytics/strength-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ─── Wellness ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Log sleep
POST {{base}}/sleep/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_date": "2026-01-20",
  "sleep_hours": 7.5,
  "sleep_quality": 4,
  "notes": "Slept well"
}

###

### Log hydration
POST {{base}}/hydration/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_date": "2026-01-20",
  "water_ml": 2500
}

###

### Log steps
POST {{base}}/steps/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_date": "2026-01-20",
  "steps": 9200,
  "distance_km": 6.8
}

# ─── Health ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### API health check
GET {{base}}/
